.","answers":[["knowledge"]],"translation":"部落對自然世界的知識非常廣博。"},{"id":"K559","part":"W","section":"History, Evidence & Change 歷史研究、證據與變遷","num":559,"head":"knowledgeable","accept":["knowledgeable"],"pos":"(adj.)","definition":"knowing a lot","meaning":"知識淵博的","example":"The ________ elder was respected for his wisdom.","answers":[["knowledgeable"]],"translation":"這位知識淵博的長老因他的智慧而受到尊敬。"},{"id":"K560","part":"W","section":"History, Evidence & Change 歷史研究、證據與變遷","num":560,"head":"manuscript","accept":["manuscript"],"pos":"(n.)","definition":"a document written by hand","meaning":"手稿","example":"The preservation of medieval ________ helps scholars reconstruct how languages changed over time.","answers":[["manuscripts"]],"translation":"保存中世紀的手稿有助於學者重建語言隨時間演變的過程。"},{"id":"K561","part":"W","section":"History, Evidence & Change 歷史研究、證據與變遷","num":561,"head":"mark","accept":["mark"],"pos":"(v.)","definition":"to show that something important has happened","meaning":"象徵；標誌著","example":"The death of the late queen ________ the end of an era, because she had ruled for most people's whole lives.","answers":[["marks"]],"translation":"已故女王的逝世標誌著一個時代的結束，因為她的統治貫穿了大多數人的一生。"},{"id":"K562","part":"W","section":"History, Evidence & Change 歷史研究、證據與變遷","num":562,"head":"mathematics","accept":["mathematics"],"pos":"(n.)","definition":"the study of numbers and shapes","meaning":"數學","example":"The ancient Greeks made significant contributions to ________, including the development of geometry.","answers":[["mathematics"]],"translation":"古希臘人對數學作出了重要貢獻，包括幾何學的發展。"},{"id":"K563","part":"W","section":"History, Evidence & Change 歷史研究、證據與變遷","num":563,"head":"modern","accept":["modern"],"pos":"(adj.)","definition":"of the present time; new","meaning":"現代的","example":"The tribe faced challenges in integrating ________ technology with their lifestyle.","answers":[["modern"]],"translation":"部落在將現代技術與他們的生活方式整合時面臨挑戰。"},{"id":"K564","part":"P","section":"History, Evidence & Change 歷史研究、證據與變遷","num":564,"he