The steam engine was a ________ invention, because it changed how goods were made and moved.","answers":[["revolutionary"]],"translation":"蒸汽機是一項革命性的發明，因為它改變了貨物的生產和運輸方式。"},{"id":"K580","part":"P","section":"History, Evidence & Change 歷史研究、證據與變遷","num":580,"head":"scientific breakthrough","accept":["scientific breakthrough"],"pos":"(n.phr.)","definition":"an important new scientific discovery","meaning":"科學突破","example":"The discovery of penicillin was a major ______ ______ that changed the course of medicine.","answers":[["scientific"],["breakthrough"]],"translation":"盤尼西林的發現是一項重大科學突破，改變了醫學的進程。"},{"id":"K581","part":"P","section":"History, Evidence & Change 歷史研究、證據與變遷","num":581,"head":"shape the understanding","accept":["shape the understanding"],"pos":"(v.phr.)","definition":"to influence how people understand something","meaning":"形塑理解","example":"The tribe's legends and stories ______ ______ ______ of their world.","answers":[["shape"],["the"],["understanding"]],"translation":"部落的傳說和故事塑造了他們對世界的理解。"},{"id":"K582","part":"P","section":"History, Evidence & Change 歷史研究、證據與變遷","num":582,"head":"shed light on","accept":["shed light on"],"pos":"(v.phr.)","definition":"to help explain something","meaning":"闡明","example":"Recent discoveries ______ ______ ______ pre-Columbian trade networks, and they show that trade reached very far.","answers":[["shed"],["light"],["on"]],"translation":"近期的發現闡明了前哥倫布時期的貿易網絡，顯示當時的貿易範圍非常遙遠。"},{"id":"K583","part":"W","section":"History, Evidence & Change 歷史研究、證據與變遷","num":583,"head":"speculate","accept":["speculate"],"pos":"(v.)","definition":"to guess without having all the facts","meaning":"推測","example":"Historians can only ________ about why the Maya left their cities, because few records survived.","answers":[["speculate"]],"translation":"歷史學家只能推測馬雅人為何離開他們的城市，因為留存下來的紀錄很少。"},{"id":"K584","part":"W","section":"History, Evidence & Change 歷史研究、證據與變遷","num":584,"head":"speculation","accept":["speculation"],"pos":"(n.)","definition":"guesses made without enough facts","meaning":"推測","example":"There was a lot of ________ about the mummy's curse, but scientists found a simple medical explanation.","answers":[["speculation"]],"translation":"關於木乃伊詛咒有很多推測，但科學家找到了簡單的醫學解釋。"},{"id":"K585","part":"W","section":"History, Evidence & Change 歷史研究、證據與變遷","num":585,"head":"transform","accept":["transform"],"pos":"(v.)","definition":"to change completely","meaning":"轉變","example":"The tribe's social structure was ________ by external influences.","answers":[["transformed"]],"translation":"部落的社會結構被外部影響轉變了。"},{"id":"K586","part":"W","section":"History, Evidence & Change 歷史研究、證據與變遷","num":586,"head":"transformation","accept":["transformation"],"pos":"(n.)","definition":"a complete change","meaning":"轉變","example":"The ________ of the tribe's culture was documented by historians.","answers":[["transformation"]],"translation":"部落文化的轉變被歷史學家記錄下來。"},{"id":"K587","part":"W","section":"History, Evidence & Change 歷史研究、證據與變遷","num":587,"head":"undergo / underwent / undergone","accept":["undergo","undergone","underwent"],"pos":"(v.)","definition":"to experience a change or process","meaning":"經歷","example":"The tribe ________ significant changes with the arrival of new technologies.","answers":[["underwent"]],"translation":"隨著新技術的到來，部落經歷了重大變化。"},{"id":"K588","part":"P","section":"History, Evidence & Change 歷史研究、證據與變遷","num":588,"head":"written history","accept":["written history"],"pos":"(n.phr.)","definition":"history recorded in writing","meaning":"書面歷史","example":"The tribe began to document their ______ ______ to preserve their stories.","answers":[["written"],["history"]],"translation":"部落開始記錄他們的書面歷史以保存他們的故事。"},{"id":"L589","part":"W","section":"Fraud & Deception 詐騙與欺騙","num":589,"head":"deceive","accept":["deceive"],"pos":"(v.)","definition":"to make someone believe something false","meaning":"欺騙","example":"The fake fortune teller ________ the villagers, and he took their money before he disappeared.","answers":[["deceived"]