nd","accept":["expand"],"pos":"(v.)","definition":"to become bigger","meaning":"擴大；擴張","example":"The empire continued to ________ for 200 years, until it controlled most of the known world.","answers":[["expand"]],"translation":"這個帝國持續擴張了兩百年，直到它控制了已知世界的大部分地區。"},{"id":"N716","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":716,"head":"experience","accept":["experience"],"pos":"(n.)","definition":"knowledge gained by doing things","meaning":"經驗","example":"The guide has years of ________ in the old city, so he knows many hidden stories.","answers":[["experience"]],"translation":"這位導遊在老城區有多年經驗，所以他知道許多鮮為人知的故事。"},{"id":"N717","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":717,"head":"experiment","accept":["experiment"],"pos":"(n.)","definition":"a scientific test to learn something","meaning":"實驗","example":"The scientist did an ________ to see how the ancient builders moved such heavy stones.","answers":[["experiment"]],"translation":"科學家做了一個實驗，看看古代工匠如何搬動如此沉重的石頭。"},{"id":"N718","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":718,"head":"expert","accept":["expert"],"pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person with special knowledge or skill","meaning":"專家","example":"An ________ in ancient coins examined the treasure, and she said it was over 1,000 years old.","answers":[["expert"]],"translation":"一位古錢幣專家鑑定了這批寶藏，她說它們已有一千多年的歷史。"},{"id":"N719","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":719,"head":"extend","accept":["extend"],"pos":"(v.)","definition":"to make something longer","meaning":"延長","example":"The museum decided to ________ the exhibition for another month, because so many people wanted to see it.","answers":[["extend"]],"translation":"博物館決定將展覽延長一個月，因為非常多人想來參觀。"},{"id":"N720","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":720,"head":"extent","accept":["extent"],"pos":"(n.)","definition":"the size or degree of something","meaning":"程度","example":"To some ________,