a complex recording system.","answers":[["knot"]],"translation":"奇普中的每一個結代表一個不同的數字或項目，使它成為一個複雜的記錄系統。"},{"id":"N726","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":726,"head":"manual","accept":["manual"],"pos":"(n.)","definition":"a book of instructions","meaning":"手冊；指南","example":"According to the ________, Halloween activities such as trick-or-treating have roots in ancient Celtic festivals.","answers":[["manual"]],"translation":"根據這本手冊，萬聖節不給糖就搗蛋等活動起源於古代凱爾特人的節慶。"},{"id":"N727","part":"P","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":727,"head":"meet the need for","accept":["meet the need for"],"pos":"(v.phr.)","definition":"to provide what is needed","meaning":"滿足對...的需求","example":"The new software aims to ______ ______ ______ ______ efficient project management in small businesses.","answers":[["meet"],["the"],["need"],["for"]],"translation":"新軟體旨在滿足小型企業對高效項目管理的需求。"},{"id":"N728","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":728,"head":"mind","accept":["mind"],"pos":"(v.)","definition":"to feel annoyed or worried by something","meaning":"介意","example":"Do you ________ if I take a photo of the temple, or are pictures not allowed inside?","answers":[["mind"]],"translation":"你介意我拍一張這座寺廟的照片嗎？還是裡面不允許拍照？"},{"id":"N729","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":729,"head":"particular","accept":["particular"],"pos":"(adj.)","definition":"special; this one and not another","meaning":"特定的；特別的","example":"This ________ temple is famous for its stone lions, and visitors touch them for good luck.","answers":[["particular"]],"translation":"這座特定的寺廟以石獅聞名，遊客會摸摸石獅祈求好運。"},{"id":"N730","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":730,"head":"passenger","accept":["passenger"],"pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person traveling in a vehicle","meaning":"乘客","example":"The ________ boarded the plane at Gate 7, and the flight attendants helped them find their seats.","answers":[["passengers"]],"translation":"乘客們在七號登機門登機，空服員協助他們找到座位。"},{"id":"N731","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":731,"head":"present","accept":["present"],"pos":"(v.)","definition":"to give or show something formally","meaning":"贈送；呈現","example":"The mayor ________ a gift to the visiting chief, and the chief thanked him with a traditional song.","answers":[["presented"]],"translation":"市長贈送禮物給來訪的酋長，酋長則以一首傳統歌曲表達感謝。"},{"id":"N732","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":732,"head":"protect","accept":["protect"],"pos":"(v.)","definition":"to keep safe from harm","meaning":"保護","example":"The villagers built a wall to ________ their homes from floods, and it still stands today.","answers":[["protect"]],"translation":"村民們建了一道牆來保護家園免受洪水侵襲，這道牆至今仍然屹立。"},{"id":"N733","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":733,"head":"protection","accept":["protection"],"pos":"(n.)","definition":"keeping someone or something safe","meaning":"保護","example":"People hung charms above their doors for ________ against evil spirits, and some families still do this.","answers":[["protection"]],"translation":"人們在門上掛護身符以保護家人免受惡靈侵擾，有些家庭至今仍這麼做。"},{"id":"N734","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":734,"head":"removal","accept":["removal"],"pos":"(n.)","definition":"the act of taking something away","meaning":"移除","example":"The ________ of the ancient wall made local people angry, because it was part of their history.","answers":[["removal"]],"translation":"古城牆的拆除讓當地居民很憤怒，因為那是他們歷史的一部分。"},{"id":"N735","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":735,"head":"remove","accept":["remove"],"pos":"(v.)","definition":"to take something away","meaning":"移除；拿走","example":"Workers carefully ________ the mud from the statue, and the old colors slowly appeared.","answers":[["removed"]],"translation":"工人們小心地清除雕像上的泥土，古老的色彩慢慢地顯露出來。"},{"id":"N736","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":736,"head":"rescue","accept":["rescue"],"pos":"(n.)","definition":"saving someone from danger","meaning":"救援","example":"The mountain climbers were in need of a ________ after being stranded by the snowstorm.","answers":[["rescue"]],"translation":"那些登山者因暴風雪而被困，需要救援。"},{"id":"N737","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":737,"head":"rescue","accept":["rescue"],"pos":"(v.)","definition":"to save someone from danger","meaning":"救援","example":"The firefighters worked tirelessly to ________ the people trapped in the burning building.","answers":[["rescue"]],"translation":"消防員不懈地努力救援被困在燃燒大樓中的人們。"},{"id":"N738","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":738,"head":"respective","accept":["respective"],"pos":"(adj.)","definition":"belonging to each one separately","meaning":"各自的","example":"The tribe's members carried out their ________ roles in the community.","answers":[["respective"]],"translation":"部落的成員在社區中執行他們各自的角色。"},{"id":"N739","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":739,"head":"respectively","accept":["respectively"],"pos":"(adv.)","definition":"in the same order as just mentioned","meaning":"分別","example":"The tribe's leaders and warriors were honored, ________.","answers":[["respectively"]],"translation":"部落的領導者和戰士分別受到了榮譽。"},{"id":"N740","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":740,"head":"reward","accept":["reward"],"pos":"(n.)","definition":"something given for doing something good","meaning":"報酬；獎賞","example":"The king offered a large ________ to anyone who could find his lost crown, so hundreds of people searched.","answers":[["reward"]],"translation":"國王懸賞一大筆賞金給任何能找到他遺失王冠的人，因此數百人參與搜尋。"},{"id":"N741","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":741,"head":"risk","accept":["risk"],"pos":"(n.)","definition":"the chance that something bad will happen","meaning":"風險","example":"The rulers took a great ________ by ignoring the warnings of their advisors.","answers":[["risk"]],"translation":"統治者忽視顧問的警告，冒了很大的風險。"},{"id":"N742","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":742,"head":"rumor","accept":["rumor"],"pos":"(n.)","definition":"a story that may not be true","meaning":"謠言","example":"A ________ spread that the old house was haunted, so nobody wanted to buy it.","answers":[["rumor"]],"translation":"有謠言說那棟老房子鬧鬼，所以沒有人想買它。"},{"id":"N743","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":743,"head":"rush","accept":["rush"],"pos":"(v.)","definition":"to move or do something very quickly","meaning":"衝去；匆忙行事","example":"Many tourists ________ to buy flight tickets after the travel restrictions were lifted.","answers":[["rushed"]],"translation":"旅遊禁令解除後，許多遊客搶著購買機票。"},{"id":"N744","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":744,"head":"safety","accept":["safety"],"pos":"(n.)","definition":"being safe from danger","meaning":"安全","example":"Parents burn incense at the temple to pray for their children's ________ before a long trip.","answers":[["safety"]],"translation":"父母會在孩子遠行前到廟裡燒香，祈求孩子的安全。"},{"id":"N745","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":745,"head":"seem","accept":["seem"],"pos":"(v.)","definition":"to appear to be","meaning":"似乎；看起來","example":"The old map ________ to show a hidden river, but historians are not sure it really existed.","answers":[["seems"]],"translation":"這張古地圖似乎標示了一條隱藏的河流，但歷史學家不確定它是否真的存在。"},{"id":"N746","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":746,"head":"signature","accept":["signature"],"pos":"(n.)","definition":"your name written in your own way","meaning":"簽名","example":"The king's ________ appears at the bottom of the treaty, which shows that he agreed to it.","answers":[["signature"]],"translation":"國王的簽名出現在條約底部，顯示他同意了這份條約。"},{"id":"N747","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":747,"head":"specific","accept":["specific"],"pos":"(adj.)","definition":"exact; particular","meaning":"特定的；明確的","example":"The ritual must be held on a ________ day of the year, which the priests decide by watching the moon.","answers":[["specific"]],"translation":"這個儀式必須在一年中特定的日子舉行，日期由祭司觀察月亮來決定。"},{"id":"N748","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":748,"head":"string","accept":["string"],"pos":"(n.)","definition":"thin rope or thick thread","meaning":"線","example":"The use of ________ in Quipu allowed for a portable and durable method to convey information.","answers":[["string"]],"translation":"在奇普中使用線條能夠提供一種便攜且耐用的資訊傳遞方法。"},{"id":"N749","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":749,"head":"therefore","accept":["therefore"],"pos":"(adv.)","definition":"for this reason; so","meaning":"因此","example":"The road to the temple was flooded; ________, the festival was moved to the following week.","answers":[["therefore"]],"translation":"通往寺廟的道路被淹沒了；因此，節慶延到了下一週。"},{"id":"N750","part":"P","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":750,"head":"those in need","accept":["those in need"],"pos":"(n.phr.)","definition":"people who need help","meaning":"需要幫助的人","example":"Charities aim to provide assistance to ______ ______ ______, especially during natural disasters.","answers":[["those"],["in"],["need"]],"translation":"慈善機構旨在為需要幫助的人提供援助，特別是在自然災害期間。"},{"id":"N751","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":751,"head":"track","accept":["track"],"pos":"(v.)","definition":"to follow the path or progress of something","meaning":"追蹤","example":"Scientists use satellites to ________ the movement of ancient trade routes buried under the sand.","answers":[["track"]],"translation":"科學家利用衛星追蹤埋藏在沙子下的古代貿易路線。"},{"id":"N752","part":"W","section":"Useful Everyday Words & Phrases 實用單字與片語","num":752,"head":"unique","accept":["unique"],"pos":"(adj.)","definition":"being the only one of its kind","meaning":"獨特的","example":"Each culture has its own ________ customs, so travelers should learn about them before visiting.","answers":[["unique"]],"translation":"每個文化都有自己獨特的習俗，所以旅客出發前應先了解。"}];
